{
    "version": "5.7.3",
    "description": "一款用 Rust 语言编写的命令行快速模糊查找工具 | A fast fuzzy finder for the command line written in Rust",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/skim-rs/skim",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "MIT"
    },
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
